title: "CosmicLens Lab — Strong-Lensing Command Deck"
abstract: "CosmicLens Lab is a browser-native gravitational-lensing console for Einstein rings, caustics, critical curves, magnification maps, Fermat potential, time delays, and strong-lensing model behaviour."
